{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"notes\": {\n    \"甲\": \"甲说明了熟悉的温柔为何虽被重新认出却无法成为当下可安住的整体，也具体解释了旧有的无着落感如何先于思考触发身体收紧、使靠近转为停顿，以及反复挽留幸福为何反而积累压力和疲惫而没有消除在乎；相对薄弱的是部分关于时间距离、坚定与承受的心理阐释超出了听感记录能够直接支持的范围。\",\n    \"乙\": \"乙借此前不同阶段的经历说明安慰为何未能真正安顿他、长期用力为何逐渐耗损力气，并把这些原因与此刻只能断续触及珍惜之物联系起来；但对221–225小节的悬空感如何引发即时的身体反应、迟疑如何在念头形成之前改变靠近的方式，以及应对努力如何反过来加重疲惫，主要停留在概括，因果链的中间环节交代不足。\"\n  },\n  \"verdict\": \"甲 版不差于 乙 版\",\n  \"why\": \"甲的优势不在篇幅或故事完整度，而在于更具体地解释了既往经验如何在此刻转化为身体反应、行为收缩和情感变化，并说明试图挽留幸福的努力如何反过来积累压力；乙的前文依据清楚，但对这些关键转折的机制解释较弱。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "d61e85c8-3465-4381-86ca-6a4e3154c0fa", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T140327464859Z", "elapsed_seconds": 46.735, "completed_utc": "2026-10-28T14:04:14.214185+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "4a8f47f617ea135574444442d7e3fe4ed65202e75e46abaf95c7cffad5f8bb4c", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc